  "rationale": "The agent misinterpreted the task as a generic `cargo update` and spent the entire trajectory pinning transitive dependencies to avoid MSRV/edition2024 errors, without ever identifying or applying the actual required dependency upgrades (e.g., smoltcp 0.10→0.11, image 0.24→0.25, windows 0.52→0.56, env_logger 0.10→0.11, etc.) specified in the reference patch. The verifier subsequently applied a test patch that introduced a compilation error (icmp_repr.emit type mismatch) which the agent's lockfile-only changes did not address, confirming the agent followed an incompatible repair strategy.",
